# ── Glossary ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
typeset -gA GENERIC_GLOSSARY
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["bind"]="Bind|Convert a quote (status=1) into an active policy (status=2). Payment is collected, coverage becomes effective. Triggers BindPolicy command -> bindquote-msg-queue -> MonitorQueues WebJob.|quote;endorse"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["endorse"]="Endorse|Mid-term policy change after binding. Examples: address change, coverage change, add mortgagee. Creates EndorsementScenario (status=13), then binds via bindendorsement-msg-queue.|bind"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["fnol"]="FNOL|First Notice of Loss. The initial report of a claim event by the insured. Triggers FNOL submission -> Snapsheet -> initiate-fnol-submission-msg-queue.|"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["cancel"]="Cancel|Terminate coverage before policy expiration. Types: non-pay cancel (NPC), company request cancel, insured request cancel. Routes through requestcancel-msg-queue or nonpaycancel-msg-queue.|nonpay_cancel;reinstate;nonrenewal"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["reinstate"]="Reinstate|Restore a cancelled policy. Only valid within reinstatement window. Routes through reinstatement-msg-queue.|cancel"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["renew"]="Renew|Issue a new policy term when current term expires. RenewalOffer WebJob creates the offer; Renewals WebJob processes the bind.|nonrenewal;bind"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["nonpay_cancel"]="Non-Pay Cancel|Cancellation triggered by missed payment. NonPayCancel WebJob + BillingNOP WebJob. Insured gets grace period before final cancel.|cancel;installment"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["rewrite"]="Rewrite|Cancel current policy and create a new one, typically for major changes or product migrations. Routes through rewrite-msg-queue.|cancel;bind"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["quote"]="Quote|A priced but unbound insurance application. Status=1. No coverage until bound. Expires if not bound.|bind;premium"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["premium"]="Premium|The price charged for insurance coverage. Calculated by RatingService using product-specific rate books.|deductible;installment;commission"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["deductible"]="Deductible|The amount the insured pays out-of-pocket before insurance pays. Part of the policy coverage terms.|premium"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["pje"]="PJE|Process Job Execution. The audit trail for every async background job. Visible at /Admin/ProcessJobExecution.|"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["acord"]="ACORD|Insurance data interchange standard. MSI uses ACORD XML for Widget<->API communication. AcordBM.cs is the 10k-line translation layer.|"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["master_policy"]="Master Policy|A community-level policy covering multiple units (apartment complex). Individual tenants get certificates underneath. MasterController handles this.|certificate;pmc"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["certificate"]="Certificate|An individual tenant's coverage document under a master policy. Part of the GroupRenters product.|master_policy"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["surplus_lines"]="Surplus Lines|Insurance placed with non-admitted (E&S) carriers. Requires surplus lines tax reporting via InsCipher. HomeownersES products are surplus lines.|es;admitted"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["admitted"]="Admitted|Insurance placed with state-regulated carriers. HomeownersAdmitted products. More regulated than E&S.|surplus_lines;es"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["es"]="E&S|Excess & Surplus. Non-admitted insurance. Less regulated. HomeownersESHO3, HomeownersESHO5, HomeownersESMS, HomeownersESREI.|surplus_lines;admitted"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["pmc"]="PMC|Property Management Company. Manages apartment communities. GroupRenters and AppFolio integrations serve PMC clients.|master_policy;certificate"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["dta"]="DTA|Direct-to-Agent. A flood portal variant where the agent is the primary user.|dtc"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["dtc"]="DTC|Direct-to-Consumer. A flood portal variant where the end customer self-serves.|dta"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["moratorium"]="Moratorium|A geographic restriction on writing new policies, typically after a natural disaster. MoratoriumController + Moratorium WebJob.|"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["ofac"]="OFAC|Office of Foreign Assets Control. Sanctions screening on new policies. OFAC WebJob + commercial-ofac-validation-msg-queue.|"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["clue"]="CLUE|Comprehensive Loss Underwriting Exchange. LexisNexis integration that pulls prior claims history during underwriting.|"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["suspense"]="Suspense|A policy hold status (code=36) where automated processing is paused. ProcessSuspense WebJob resolves them.|"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["nonrenewal"]="Non-Renewal|Decision not to renew a policy at expiration. PendingNonRenewal -> NonRenewal WebJob -> nonrenewal-msg-queue.|renew;cancel"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["commission"]="Commission|Compensation paid to agents for written premium. CommissionService + AgencyCommissionDownload WebJob.|premium"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["installment"]="Installment|A payment plan where premium is paid in scheduled partial amounts. Installment WebJob processes scheduled charges.|premium;nonpay_cancel"
GENERIC_GLOSSARY["econsent"]="eConsent|Electronic consent to receive policy documents via email instead of paper. EConsentNotification WebJob.|"
